  <!-- Register named UTIs for formats that macOS otherwise resolves to a per-machine
       dynamic UTI (dyn.*). Without this, these files are filtered out in Spotlight-backed
       virtual folders (Smart Folders / Recents / Tags) of the Open panel, even though they
       show fine in normal directories. Formats with a system UTI (stl/obj/svg/ply/usd*/abc)
       need no entry here. -->
